{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25947","headline":"元日早朝行 · 鲍溶","name":"元日早朝行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乾元发生春爲宗，盛德在天斗建东。\n东方岁星大明宫，南山喜气摇晴空。\n望云五等舞万玉，献寿一声出千峯。\n文章垂彩礼乐正，太白下直旌旗红。\n旌旗不断春风前，直如朱绳非尔妍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}